{"title":"Frog","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 31 total, 31 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 376 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 291 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 78 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1495, 70 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"frog\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/crab\">Crab</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deer\">Deer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sheep\">Sheep</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-black\">Black Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-brown\">Brown Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-white\">White Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/794ce9655b1ef3e83a5e.webp\" alt=\"Frog\"></div><h3>Frog</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–1)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Wildlife</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>12</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>50</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2,893 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}